---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Contact"
  description="Contact Eric Nolan and find his public engineering work."
>
  <header class="page-header">
    <div class="shell">
      <p class="eyebrow">Contact</p>
      <h1>Start with the work.</h1>
      <p class="lede">
        GitHub is the best place to inspect the public implementations. Email works for everything that needs an actual conversation.
      </p>
    </div>
  </header>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="shell split-feature">
      <div class="prose">
        <h2>GitHub</h2>
        <p><a class="text-link" href="https://github.com/unyieldingclaw-dev">github.com/unyieldingclaw-dev →</a></p>

        <h2>Email</h2>
        <p><a class="text-link" href="mailto:unyieldingclaw@gmail.com">unyieldingclaw@gmail.com</a></p>
      </div>

      <aside class="feature-note">
        <strong>What is intentionally not here</strong>
        <p>This site does not publish employer-internal material, confidential implementations, credentials, customer data, or source code from private projects merely to make a portfolio look more complete.</p>
      </aside>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
